  {
    "block_id": "Hb2Pdp0bHoRiyBx2FBPcXf3Dndd",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "面试官开头就说本次面试有四个阶段：自我介绍，手撕，问答，反问。实际上先自我介绍就问了几个问题，然后再手撕。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "1"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "RiH0dtQ3yo9x0ixE6uhcaqxUnJx",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "问了实习里负责什么项目，接手项目以后觉得好的点，我说是多语言，一方面vue转react了解了react的工程化实践，另一方面做需求的时候也对项目了解更深入。然后我还延伸到组件提取复用之类的点。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "Vdhed4dwZoopxPxgZ4ccFn4cnVc",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "接着问性能优化，这个问了很多。给了个场景，首屏加载慢，怎么排查，我回答先看请求时间长不长，是不是阻塞渲染，接着看传输内容大不大，js和css代码复不复杂。然后问优化手段，实际上我自我介绍就已经讲了我做过哪些性能优化。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "XQQMd39KwotJJ7xngOBctEqIncc",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "接下来继续问八股，重排重绘触发，怎么减少。我回答虚拟dom节点和代码本身就尽量简单。然后问我defer和async的区别。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "XE9OdrCwMoIvY2xS9ODcxdDWnTc",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "然后问我性能优化怎么获得优化前后数据。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
