    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "开发到部署的流程，主要是问怎么打包的。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "EmgmdbTKioFA3pxcmGLct6Vlnkg",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "手撕：版本号比较，样例有‘1.01’和‘1.1’， ‘2.5’和‘2.4’， ‘5.4.3.2’和‘5.4.3’。很简单，我暴力做的，问我怎么优化，我说可以用startwith找共同前缀。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false,
        "sequence": "auto"
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "INB1dQDEHo0zuGxh5t1c7AH8nih"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "AccidwJMZoUo8rx3Axjc7lmunbd",
    "block_type": 13,
    "ordered": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "问ai相关，我感觉面试官不懂技术，问我用什么ai，ai会不会取代开发人员，怎么取代，要求我们去扩大知识广度吗。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
